#: config.cpp:40
msgid "Draw titlebar &stipple effect"
msgstr "&Ruge Titelbalkens wiesen"

#: config.cpp:42
msgid ""
"When selected, active titlebars are drawn with a stipple (dotted) effect. "
"Otherwise, they are drawn without the stipple."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit aktiveert is, warrt lütte Pricken op de Titelbalkens teekt, se "
"seht dormit wat ruuch ut. Sünst sünd se glatt."

#: config.cpp:46
msgid "Draw g&rab bar below windows"
msgstr "&Greepbalken nerrn de Finstern wiesen"

#: config.cpp:48
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with a \"grab bar\" below windows. "
"Otherwise, no grab bar is drawn."
msgstr "Wenn dit aktiveert is, warrt en Balken to'n Anfaten nerrn de Finstern wiest."

#: config.cpp:54
msgid "Draw &gradients"
msgstr "Klören &verlopen laten"

#: config.cpp:56
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with gradients for highcolor displays, "
"otherwise no gradients are drawn."
msgstr ""
"Wenn dit aktiveert is, warrt op Dorstellen-Reedschappen mit mehr as 64.000 "
"Klören de Dekoratschonen so wiest, dat de Klören inenanner lopen."
